        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>OMN 2300, Omnia Lever x Lever Mortise Lock Box </b> \r\n<p>\r\nThis is a replacement mortise lock body for mortise deadbolt entry sets with a lever on each side.  Includes faceplate and strike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Mortise Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a lever from either side. </li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time. </li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever inside and by key outside. The outside lever is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise box for Omnia entrysets with lever x lever (lever on both sides of door). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Mortise box, face plate, and strike only. Does NOT include trim, lock cylinders, or levers.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Lever x Lever Mortise Lock Box, OMN 2300",
                "description": "This is a replacement mortise lock body for mortise deadbolt entry sets with a lever on each side.  ",
